===History of classification===

* Foerste assigned to Eocrinoidea<ref>{{harvnb|Sprinkle|1973|p=62}}</ref>
* Durham to Lepidocystidae, Lepidocystoidea
* Sprinkle to Lepidocystidae, Imbricata, Eocrinoidea
* Nardin ''et al.'' to Lepidocystidae (as Lepidocystoidae), Blastozoa
* Wang ''et al.'' to Lepidocystidae, Blastozoa


a Palaeozoic genus of imbricate lepidocystoid [[eocrinoid]], closely related to ''[[Kinzercystis]]'',<ref>{{harvnb|Paul|Smith|1984}}</ref><ref>{{harvnb|Smith|Zamora|2013}}</ref> It bore a stalk, with which it attached to firm substrates;<ref>{{harvnb|Zamora|Deline|Álvaro|Rahman|2017}}</ref> and [[brachioles]] arising as lateral branches from its arms.<ref>{{harvnb|Paul|1984}}</ref>

It is only known from the late Botomian=[[Cambrian Series 2]] Kinzers Formation.<ref>{{harvnb|Nohejlová|Nardin|Fatka|Kašička|Sabad|2019}}</ref>

